  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the development of Tanzania&#x2019;s Development Vison TDV2050 (Phase I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Investment and Planning (MIP) is a newly established ministry working on an ambitious timeline to deliver TDV2050.  MIP recognise the ambitious targets of TDV2025 were not delivered, especially linked to jobs and economic growth.  

This work will support MIP to develop an evidence base to understand what sectors are most likely to drive future job creation and economic growth.  Secondly it will help improve consultation with the private sector to build a broad consensus on the development vision, helping to improve policy making around business and investment environment reforms.  

We will support the Planning Commission. The support for the development of the TDV2050 is expected to improve transformation prospects through improved policy making.</narrative>
  </description>
